{
  "bvid": "BV19i421h7tz",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "583e1293763ace446baf101a58b38c0970540a090c4422c8961ccce69dc60d6a",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1960,
      "text": "比王佐更糟的是望左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 3360,
      "end_ms": 6080,
      "text": "望左的规模现在也挺大的了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 6600,
      "end_ms": 9220,
      "text": "那么去年我们端掉了一个望左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 9220,
      "end_ms": 10640,
      "text": "他不是往左啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 10640,
      "end_ms": 14760,
      "text": "他有线下的一些可以说比较危险的行动了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 14760,
      "end_ms": 15890,
      "text": "行为了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 15890,
      "end_ms": 19950,
      "text": "这些行为只会给人民群众造造成损害伤害"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 19950,
      "end_ms": 21690,
      "text": "然后他对他的这个行动行为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 21690,
      "end_ms": 28240,
      "text": "又是在网络上大肆宣扬望左肆意妄为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 28240,
      "end_ms": 32189,
      "text": "往左而往左是很低龄化了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 32189,
      "end_ms": 36170,
      "text": "往左最小是到这个小学生都有了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 36170,
      "end_ms": 38459,
      "text": "那么这些望左呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 38459,
      "end_ms": 40619,
      "text": "望佐的年龄在越来越小"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 40619,
      "end_ms": 42119,
      "text": "越来越低龄化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 42119,
      "end_ms": 43619,
      "text": "望佐年龄低龄化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 43619,
      "end_ms": 44820,
      "text": "目前是高中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 44820,
      "end_ms": 47380,
      "text": "去年呢是大学在校学生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 47380,
      "end_ms": 48660,
      "text": "大一大二的水准"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 49900,
      "end_ms": 52790,
      "text": "大一刚刚就读大二的一个水准"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 52950,
      "end_ms": 55590,
      "text": "现在这个情况已经进展到发展到高中了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 55590,
      "end_ms": 59120,
      "text": "一些望族肆意妄为的望族"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 59120,
      "end_ms": 61160,
      "text": "那么这个左呢不是真的左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 62160,
      "end_ms": 65959,
      "text": "它并不是真正是在进行劳工运动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 65959,
      "end_ms": 70019,
      "text": "它只是借助在我们国家政治正确的劳工的话语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 70019,
      "end_ms": 75310,
      "text": "劳工权益的话语实际上是在表达的是自由派的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 75310,
      "end_ms": 77330,
      "text": "代表的是小资产阶级的利益"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 77330,
      "end_ms": 78870,
      "text": "代表的是城市小市民"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 78870,
      "end_ms": 81210,
      "text": "小资产阶级小富人的利益"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 82490,
      "end_ms": 87170,
      "text": "他们没有这个呃把握经济结构啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 87170,
      "end_ms": 89690,
      "text": "生产再生产关系的能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 89690,
      "end_ms": 92470,
      "text": "思考能力上就是没有这个能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 92710,
      "end_ms": 94890,
      "text": "那么这一批望左呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 94890,
      "end_ms": 98930,
      "text": "目前在为代表的是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 98930,
      "end_ms": 105730,
      "text": "被B站的一群网左所追吹捧追捧的几个up主"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 105730,
      "end_ms": 106950,
      "text": "哪几个我不点名"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 106950,
      "end_ms": 110860,
      "text": "大家都知道他们的妄狂妄妄在哪里呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 110860,
      "end_ms": 116949,
      "text": "在QQ群群聊里面已经说自己具有什么军社啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 121909,
      "end_ms": 126330,
      "text": "他们还把自己的QQ群啊弄了好多个群"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 126330,
      "end_ms": 131660,
      "text": "把这叫这个组织叫做鹿鹿马呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 131660,
      "end_ms": 133880,
      "text": "那个那个指鹿为马的鹿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 133880,
      "end_ms": 138179,
      "text": "然后里面有各种是什么联络部啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 138179,
      "end_ms": 139670,
      "text": "总参谋部"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 139670,
      "end_ms": 142070,
      "text": "中央什么什么局啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 142070,
      "end_ms": 143970,
      "text": "已经开始沐猴而冠了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 143970,
      "end_ms": 146810,
      "text": "自封各种是什么职务了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 146810,
      "end_ms": 150790,
      "text": "而且有明明确的那种等级人身依附关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 150790,
      "end_ms": 156250,
      "text": "谁是把他们那个最大的up主称之为成就"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 156250,
      "end_ms": 157530,
      "text": "当成领袖啊什么的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 157530,
      "end_ms": 163940,
      "text": "然后呃这完全是妄作妄作凶啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 165020,
      "end_ms": 166860,
      "text": "只是一些不谙世事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 166860,
      "end_ms": 174030,
      "text": "然后是被一些行愚之人坐过牢的一些老逼灯啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 174030,
      "end_ms": 176730,
      "text": "给他养出这些小孩的野心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 176730,
      "end_ms": 178670,
      "text": "让这些小孩去冲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 179150,
      "end_ms": 180290,
      "text": "甚至在线下冲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 180290,
      "end_ms": 183690,
      "text": "他们群聊里面竟然还狂妄的说什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 183690,
      "end_ms": 186160,
      "text": "要把他们小组拆拆"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 186160,
      "end_ms": 187600,
      "text": "散到各地去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 187600,
      "end_ms": 191110,
      "text": "成立新小组已经很狂妄了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 191110,
      "end_ms": 192270,
      "text": "妄作凶啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 192270,
      "end_ms": 195250,
      "text": "这东西都发生在我们眼皮子底下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 195250,
      "end_ms": 197830,
      "text": "就是某种疯狂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 198200,
      "end_ms": 202240,
      "text": "而且是啊是成年人和未成年人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 202240,
      "end_ms": 204680,
      "text": "是掺杂在他们那些群里面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 204680,
      "end_ms": 208910,
      "text": "有一些是一些有老案底的老人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 209390,
      "end_ms": 210830,
      "text": "那是国家可怜你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 210830,
      "end_ms": 212110,
      "text": "给你恢复了通信自由"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 212110,
      "end_ms": 215220,
      "text": "有一些是些中年人有社会不满的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 219130,
      "end_ms": 222450,
      "text": "那有一些是一些20多岁社会化失败的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 222450,
      "end_ms": 223790,
      "text": "一些年轻人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 223790,
      "end_ms": 225980,
      "text": "还有一些就是这种小孩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 225980,
      "end_ms": 227640,
      "text": "十几岁的小孩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 227640,
      "end_ms": 231579,
      "text": "这些人都是望人狂妄至极"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 231819,
      "end_ms": 233859,
      "text": "一点现实的社会力量都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 233859,
      "end_ms": 237839,
      "text": "你说他已经掌握了什么多少个村庄啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 237839,
      "end_ms": 240579,
      "text": "已经是掌握了多少个地下工厂啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 240579,
      "end_ms": 241759,
      "text": "这个他妈的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 241759,
      "end_ms": 244339,
      "text": "好歹我们也把当成是他妈正常人看待"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 244339,
      "end_ms": 246819,
      "text": "比如说他这个是现实的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 246819,
      "end_ms": 248790,
      "text": "有物质基础的在做事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 248790,
      "end_ms": 249670,
      "text": "这些人在干嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 250710,
      "end_ms": 251830,
      "text": "这些人搞来搞去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 251830,
      "end_ms": 252470,
      "text": "搞来搞去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 252470,
      "end_ms": 256339,
      "text": "最后拱这些高中生小屁孩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 256339,
      "end_ms": 257779,
      "text": "他是少年犯啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 257779,
      "end_ms": 258779,
      "text": "我说不是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 258779,
      "end_ms": 262499,
      "text": "目前不是你拱他们去做的那些错事了之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 262499,
      "end_ms": 263319,
      "text": "那就变少年犯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 263319,
      "end_ms": 265019,
      "text": "国家很难处理呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 265019,
      "end_ms": 267289,
      "text": "很头很大呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 267289,
      "end_ms": 268729,
      "text": "不处理不是处理的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 268729,
      "end_ms": 271030,
      "text": "不是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 271030,
      "end_ms": 272890,
      "text": "他们就开始玩这一招了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 272890,
      "end_ms": 277960,
      "text": "下沉那妄作凶比旺比王佐更糟糕的是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 277960,
      "end_ms": 282430,
      "text": "望族这群妄佐呢已经开始下沉到高中生市场了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 282630,
      "end_ms": 284870,
      "text": "搁这他妈的cosplay也就算了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 284870,
      "end_ms": 290630,
      "text": "还还要向现实投射输送权力体系和暴力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 291050,
      "end_ms": 292210,
      "text": "在群里面装逼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 292210,
      "end_ms": 296170,
      "text": "说自己有什么有枪到这种程度了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 298880,
      "end_ms": 300000,
      "text": "口嗨啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 300000,
      "end_ms": 301480,
      "text": "口嗨涉及暴力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 301480,
      "end_ms": 301800,
      "text": "口嗨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 301800,
      "end_ms": 303960,
      "text": "那不是一般的口嗨啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 305470,
      "end_ms": 307550,
      "text": "狂妄至极"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 308580,
      "end_ms": 310140,
      "text": "这个就跟什么理论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 310140,
      "end_ms": 310820,
      "text": "什么科学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 310820,
      "end_ms": 314360,
      "text": "什么什么都没关系啦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 321740,
      "end_ms": 323120,
      "text": "你还是打什么女权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 323120,
      "end_ms": 324380,
      "text": "什么什么旗号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 324380,
      "end_ms": 328350,
      "text": "你就开始各地封官爵了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 328470,
      "end_ms": 332030,
      "text": "就开始吹嘘自己有武装力量了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 332030,
      "end_ms": 333590,
      "text": "你口嗨口嗨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 333590,
      "end_ms": 337190,
      "text": "这个东西不管你的政治意识形态是什么的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 337870,
      "end_ms": 339510,
      "text": "你用任何政治意识形态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 343390,
      "end_ms": 344510,
      "text": "还搞人身崇拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 344510,
      "end_ms": 345680,
      "text": "人身依附"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 345680,
      "end_ms": 349480,
      "text": "龚一群高中小孩玩这个游戏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 351200,
      "end_ms": 355540,
      "text": "这是妄作妄作在妄作啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 355540,
      "end_ms": 358040,
      "text": "不知常妄作凶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 360140,
      "end_ms": 363140,
      "text": "啊所有这些往左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 364180,
      "end_ms": 367540,
      "text": "我们这个术语是我发明的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 367540,
      "end_ms": 369580,
      "text": "我会比较详细的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 374530,
      "end_ms": 375990,
      "text": "然后我告诉你们啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 375990,
      "end_ms": 378050,
      "text": "比如说你们崇拜的一些老同志"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 378050,
      "end_ms": 380230,
      "text": "在我们看来也是妄作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 380230,
      "end_ms": 381670,
      "text": "他不是王左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 381670,
      "end_ms": 383190,
      "text": "他也不是什么线下的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 383190,
      "end_ms": 386300,
      "text": "什么非常有根基的行行动派"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 386300,
      "end_ms": 389140,
      "text": "他就是倍狂背"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 389140,
      "end_ms": 390909,
      "text": "狂妄至极"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 390909,
      "end_ms": 394529,
      "text": "他做的那事情根本在现实中没有生根发芽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 394529,
      "end_ms": 395609,
      "text": "落地的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 395609,
      "end_ms": 398169,
      "text": "获得历史的回响的那种机会的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 398169,
      "end_ms": 400049,
      "text": "纯粹是捣乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 400209,
      "end_ms": 401889,
      "text": "纯粹是弄丑闻"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 401889,
      "end_ms": 403289,
      "text": "干脏事儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 403289,
      "end_ms": 405669,
      "text": "纯粹是自杀性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 405669,
      "end_ms": 406649,
      "text": "毁灭性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 406649,
      "end_ms": 408370,
      "text": "自杀性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 408370,
      "end_ms": 410730,
      "text": "就这些好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 410730,
      "end_ms": 413200,
      "text": "好像自己是革命战士"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 413200,
      "end_ms": 416510,
      "text": "好像自己是伟大的这个革命家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 416510,
      "end_ms": 417910,
      "text": "这都啥呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 417910,
      "end_ms": 421310,
      "text": "纯粹破坏这个做的严重的是恐怖分子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 421310,
      "end_ms": 424670,
      "text": "做的轻微的就是疯子精神病"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 425090,
      "end_ms": 428550,
      "text": "这都处处于一种精神病理化狂妄的一个状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 428550,
      "end_ms": 433080,
      "text": "那么这种狂妄的状态延伸到小孩身上去了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 433080,
      "end_ms": 435760,
      "text": "这小孩他这个心里还有修复的可能性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 435760,
      "end_ms": 437489,
      "text": "那些二三十岁的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 437489,
      "end_ms": 439169,
      "text": "这那中年的还是那老年的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 439169,
      "end_ms": 442780,
      "text": "那精神失常已经没有修复的可能性了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 443340,
      "end_ms": 447100,
      "text": "王佐开始崇拜这群望左了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 447730,
      "end_ms": 450790,
      "text": "这是个很值得观察的现象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 450790,
      "end_ms": 453270,
      "text": "越狂妄越他妈无脑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 453270,
      "end_ms": 454350,
      "text": "越"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 454350,
      "end_ms": 456610,
      "text": "越好像犯病一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 456610,
      "end_ms": 458530,
      "text": "这些王佐越崇拜他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 458530,
      "end_ms": 460330,
      "text": "这是个小自然界的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 460330,
      "end_ms": 462170,
      "text": "就像那群望族里面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 462170,
      "end_ms": 463130,
      "text": "有些唯唯诺诺的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 463130,
      "end_ms": 466410,
      "text": "一些小孩会崇拜他那个大哥领袖一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 466410,
      "end_ms": 468130,
      "text": "其实那大哥领袖屁都不是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 468130,
      "end_ms": 470250,
      "text": "就是狂妄勇莽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 470250,
      "end_ms": 471190,
      "text": "仅此而已"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 471190,
      "end_ms": 472410,
      "text": "一一点学问都没有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 472410,
      "end_ms": 474370,
      "text": "包括之前那个编选集的那个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 474370,
      "end_ms": 477050,
      "text": "包括现在这个小孩一点本事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 477050,
      "end_ms": 477850,
      "text": "一点能力都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 477850,
      "end_ms": 479990,
      "text": "他就是狂妄瞎做瞎搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 479990,
      "end_ms": 482049,
      "text": "他敢去担责任嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 482049,
      "end_ms": 483329,
      "text": "他真的能担责任吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 483329,
      "end_ms": 485620,
      "text": "担不了他就是鲁莽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 485620,
      "end_ms": 490380,
      "text": "那么类似的这群王佐崇拜这群望族也是一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 490380,
      "end_ms": 491060,
      "text": "思想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 491060,
      "end_ms": 493049,
      "text": "一样的规则"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 493049,
      "end_ms": 495549,
      "text": "就是无非就是一群孬货"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 495549,
      "end_ms": 498030,
      "text": "孬种去拜一个疯子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 498030,
      "end_ms": 500810,
      "text": "拜一群好像有胆有勇的一个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 500810,
      "end_ms": 501570,
      "text": "这个东西的嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 501570,
      "end_ms": 503090,
      "text": "我们精确的评价定义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 503090,
      "end_ms": 506640,
      "text": "这个东西是小资产阶级里面长出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 506640,
      "end_ms": 507920,
      "text": "Protofascism"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 507920,
      "end_ms": 509870,
      "text": "原法西斯主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 509870,
      "end_ms": 512570,
      "text": "他是亲自由主义经济秩序的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 512570,
      "end_ms": 515578,
      "text": "他是亲近于自由主义经济秩序的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 515578,
      "end_ms": 519558,
      "text": "但是呢他是要一个没有资本主义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 519558,
      "end_ms": 523010,
      "text": "或者没有自由主义的弊端的自由主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 523010,
      "end_ms": 527800,
      "text": "他们所所盼望所所想要获得的是没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 527800,
      "end_ms": 530700,
      "text": "比如说没有道德败坏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 530700,
      "end_ms": 532360,
      "text": "没有贪污腐败"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 532360,
      "end_ms": 534000,
      "text": "没有环境污染"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 534000,
      "end_ms": 537960,
      "text": "没有这个家庭生活的窒息啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 537960,
      "end_ms": 539600,
      "text": "没有是没有压迫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 539600,
      "end_ms": 541160,
      "text": "没有什么的资本主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 541160,
      "end_ms": 543280,
      "text": "没有资本主义的坏处的资本主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 543280,
      "end_ms": 545790,
      "text": "他们要的是一个纯资本主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 545990,
      "end_ms": 547030,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 554180,
      "end_ms": 555640,
      "text": "也意味着集权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 555640,
      "end_ms": 557010,
      "text": "也意味着控制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 557010,
      "end_ms": 560400,
      "text": "也意味着某种形式上的剥夺和压迫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 566320,
      "end_ms": 569570,
      "text": "他们呢明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 569570,
      "end_ms": 572430,
      "text": "他们往往只是打着道德议题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 572430,
      "end_ms": 576170,
      "text": "或者打着一些纯粹的对于社会阴暗面的不满的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 576170,
      "end_ms": 578035,
      "text": "揭露这些旗号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 578109,
      "end_ms": 578869,
      "text": "然后呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 578869,
      "end_ms": 582669,
      "text": "他们自己是不表达自己的经济政治的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 582669,
      "end_ms": 584150,
      "text": "药方呢也没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 586490,
      "end_ms": 587370,
      "text": "他要怎么分配"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 587370,
      "end_ms": 587990,
      "text": "怎么分配"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 587990,
      "end_ms": 590850,
      "text": "什么机制来分配权利吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 591300,
      "end_ms": 593680,
      "text": "那这个权利又用什么东西来调和"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 593680,
      "end_ms": 597920,
      "text": "他最后背后所幻想的又是一个供需系统"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 597920,
      "end_ms": 598900,
      "text": "自动平衡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 598900,
      "end_ms": 600390,
      "text": "那不就又市场吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 600390,
      "end_ms": 603470,
      "text": "他们妄想的就是说没有剥削性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 603470,
      "end_ms": 606500,
      "text": "压迫性的集中性的统治性的权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 606500,
      "end_ms": 609580,
      "text": "供需市场自动平衡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 611460,
      "end_ms": 614560,
      "text": "这个就是没有资本主义的资本主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 614560,
      "end_ms": 618669,
      "text": "这个就是市场没有市场弊端的市场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 618669,
      "end_ms": 622049,
      "text": "那么这些人呢其实在我们看来都是小资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 625840,
      "end_ms": 629600,
      "text": "我指的那群王者和他们背后的家庭啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 629600,
      "end_ms": 631400,
      "text": "他PC评的是法西斯主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 631400,
      "end_ms": 633829,
      "text": "原法西斯主义PROTOFCISM"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 633829,
      "end_ms": 636669,
      "text": "然后呢是亲和于自由主义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 636669,
      "end_ms": 638429,
      "text": "资本主义的市场体系的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 638429,
      "end_ms": 640910,
      "text": "但是呢他不想要里面的弊端"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 641150,
      "end_ms": 644170,
      "text": "是就是这种人理论上我给他鉴定清楚了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 644170,
      "end_ms": 647950,
      "text": "他喜欢披着这些皮表演演戏也就罢了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 647950,
      "end_ms": 650950,
      "text": "那么刚刚那个视频我已经发下呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 650950,
      "end_ms": 652030,
      "text": "我已经提出建议了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 652030,
      "end_ms": 652750,
      "text": "不是发下命令啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 652750,
      "end_ms": 653990,
      "text": "我已经提出建议了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 653990,
      "end_ms": 657010,
      "text": "就这两个人统统清掉好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 657010,
      "end_ms": 658510,
      "text": "两类人统统清掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 658510,
      "end_ms": 662170,
      "text": "然后凡是有小孩喜欢跟那群人混的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 662170,
      "end_ms": 663610,
      "text": "通通拉黑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 663930,
      "end_ms": 665990,
      "text": "就是高中生3年五年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 665990,
      "end_ms": 666690,
      "text": "10年之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 666690,
      "end_ms": 670889,
      "text": "这些人goodbye通通拉黑啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 670889,
      "end_ms": 672529,
      "text": "我查到有记录的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 672529,
      "end_ms": 675349,
      "text": "做交代不行就就退掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 675349,
      "end_ms": 676749,
      "text": "清掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 676970,
      "end_ms": 680550,
      "text": "这些人都叫妄作妄作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 680550,
      "end_ms": 684920,
      "text": "凶的妄作妄左瞎逼搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 684920,
      "end_ms": 689180,
      "text": "这在我看来就是轻微的精神病理化的病人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 689180,
      "end_ms": 692840,
      "text": "他表达的是小市民阶级的政治意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 693210,
      "end_ms": 695290,
      "text": "他是表也有政治表达在里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 695290,
      "end_ms": 697070,
      "text": "但是表达小市民级的政治意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 697070,
      "end_ms": 699250,
      "text": "比如说他把那什么哲学口号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 699250,
      "end_ms": 701339,
      "text": "经济口号非常教条化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 701339,
      "end_ms": 702859,
      "text": "他这个表达了一种什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 702859,
      "end_ms": 706139,
      "text": "我我拥有某种秩序性的符号性的语言"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 706139,
      "end_ms": 710020,
      "text": "就对于生产生活啊可以加以干涉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 710020,
      "end_ms": 711700,
      "text": "就小资人义的小资人义相比"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 711700,
      "end_ms": 712180,
      "text": "劳动群众"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 712180,
      "end_ms": 714910,
      "text": "不就是多了一些秩序性的符号性的语言吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 714910,
      "end_ms": 716130,
      "text": "一些口号吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 716130,
      "end_ms": 717130,
      "text": "一些理论吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 717130,
      "end_ms": 722109,
      "text": "或者一些道德自我标榜的一些评据吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 722109,
      "end_ms": 723909,
      "text": "这不就比别人更干净一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 723909,
      "end_ms": 725049,
      "text": "更文绉绉一点嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 725049,
      "end_ms": 728180,
      "text": "小资产阶级相比于无产阶级劳动群众咳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 728180,
      "end_ms": 729620,
      "text": "他们就是要用这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 729620,
      "end_ms": 731290,
      "text": "要把这个东西炒得还很贵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 731290,
      "end_ms": 733350,
      "text": "在他们那边群众没有劳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 733350,
      "end_ms": 735690,
      "text": "没有他所谓的这个运动领袖重要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 735690,
      "end_ms": 737890,
      "text": "运动领袖只要沾一点点文气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 737890,
      "end_ms": 739540,
      "text": "只要沾一点点啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 739540,
      "end_ms": 743060,
      "text": "书生书卷气又有一点点领那种领袖号召气质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 743060,
      "end_ms": 743840,
      "text": "戴个什么帽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 743840,
      "end_ms": 745020,
      "text": "你说小孩扮演"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 745020,
      "end_ms": 748120,
      "text": "小孩扮演扮演出来透露出来这种政治意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 748120,
      "end_ms": 750060,
      "text": "就是一种小资人义自我迷恋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 750060,
      "end_ms": 751360,
      "text": "他的父母家庭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 751360,
      "end_ms": 753900,
      "text": "是整个他的所处的那个社会阶层"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 753900,
      "end_ms": 755440,
      "text": "所表达的政治意志"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 755440,
      "end_ms": 759750,
      "text": "是穿过透过这个小孩的这种抽象的行为艺术"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 759750,
      "end_ms": 763590,
      "text": "抽象行为艺术加引号啊来表现出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 763590,
      "end_ms": 765390,
      "text": "它是一种原法西斯主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 765390,
      "end_ms": 766410,
      "text": "是一种小占领"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 766410,
      "end_ms": 767210,
      "text": "市民阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 767210,
      "end_ms": 768850,
      "text": "是小市民阶级特有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 768850,
      "end_ms": 771370,
      "text": "原法西斯主义是亲和于自由主义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 771370,
      "end_ms": 772290,
      "text": "亲和与自由主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 772290,
      "end_ms": 775050,
      "text": "因为他们最后幻想了个药方权利如何架构"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 778820,
      "end_ms": 783820,
      "text": "如何制衡里面的各式各样的利益格局"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 783820,
      "end_ms": 787160,
      "text": "生产再生产的机制如何如何均衡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 787160,
      "end_ms": 788200,
      "text": "如何设计"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 788200,
      "end_ms": 789569,
      "text": "完全不知道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 789569,
      "end_ms": 790709,
      "text": "彻底无知"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 790709,
      "end_ms": 792249,
      "text": "他只能去幻想哎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 792249,
      "end_ms": 795280,
      "text": "有有一种自动的自发的一个供需平衡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 795280,
      "end_ms": 797560,
      "text": "只要我们克服资本主义那些错误的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 797560,
      "end_ms": 798680,
      "text": "只要我们不要那些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 798680,
      "end_ms": 801470,
      "text": "我们就有个自发的完美的供需平衡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 801470,
      "end_ms": 802670,
      "text": "最后是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 802670,
      "end_ms": 808770,
      "text": "最后最后药方呼之而出的是一种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 809290,
      "end_ms": 811490,
      "text": "搞不要先锋队的工团主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 811490,
      "end_ms": 812890,
      "text": "然后里面是自由推选的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 812890,
      "end_ms": 813730,
      "text": "然后再进一步"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 813730,
      "end_ms": 814730,
      "text": "那就是自由主义了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 814730,
      "end_ms": 816150,
      "text": "那就是选票政治了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 816150,
      "end_ms": 818464,
      "text": "那就是搞什么明代了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 818650,
      "end_ms": 820010,
      "text": "就是这个代议制劳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 820010,
      "end_ms": 821530,
      "text": "西方代议制劳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 821530,
      "end_ms": 824810,
      "text": "所以这些人最后要念的那个政治基因"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 824810,
      "end_ms": 826220,
      "text": "就是西方代议制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 826220,
      "end_ms": 827580,
      "text": "中间念的经济经营"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 827580,
      "end_ms": 829780,
      "text": "就是幻想一个没有资本主义弊端的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 829780,
      "end_ms": 834330,
      "text": "自动的供需制衡的供需均衡的一个市场机制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 834330,
      "end_ms": 835730,
      "text": "只不过它不叫它市场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 835730,
      "end_ms": 839319,
      "text": "他叫他什么普鲁东主义劳动银行什么东西的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 839639,
      "end_ms": 843500,
      "text": "那么这些货色呢啊无一例外"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 843500,
      "end_ms": 847360,
      "text": "无一例外他们通过扮演一个虚假的无能"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 847360,
      "end_ms": 850700,
      "text": "看上去好像让小孩扮演先锋队"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 850700,
      "end_ms": 852300,
      "text": "这个小孩一点本事都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 852300,
      "end_ms": 852820,
      "text": "就是勇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 852820,
      "end_ms": 853460,
      "text": "就是莽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 853460,
      "end_ms": 854660,
      "text": "一点能力都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 854660,
      "end_ms": 855480,
      "text": "很无知"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 855480,
      "end_ms": 856720,
      "text": "一点能力都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 856720,
      "end_ms": 858960,
      "text": "那那为什么他们要让一个无知的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 858960,
      "end_ms": 860680,
      "text": "又莽又又蠢的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 860680,
      "end_ms": 863690,
      "text": "就扮演这个一个头头的这么一个形象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 863690,
      "end_ms": 866570,
      "text": "他其实就是要抹黑我们的先锋队"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 866570,
      "end_ms": 870480,
      "text": "他的实质的逻辑就是要抹黑我们的先锋队"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 870960,
      "end_ms": 874540,
      "text": "通过盲从一个不够格的一个头头"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 874540,
      "end_ms": 877420,
      "text": "来抹黑我们人民群众真正追随的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 877420,
      "end_ms": 880000,
      "text": "真正去拥护的先锋队"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 880200,
      "end_ms": 882560,
      "text": "就这种脊梁小自然界脊梁小"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 882560,
      "end_ms": 885080,
      "text": "自然界在网络上造景的脊梁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 885510,
      "end_ms": 888390,
      "text": "那么这样做的这群人就被推到前台去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 888390,
      "end_ms": 889430,
      "text": "做演员的扮演"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 889430,
      "end_ms": 891350,
      "text": "一个不合格的扮演一个非常无能的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 891350,
      "end_ms": 892710,
      "text": "就又又非常鲁莽的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 892710,
      "end_ms": 896070,
      "text": "非常愚蠢的这么一个头目的这么一群人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 896070,
      "end_ms": 898089,
      "text": "我们把它叫做妄作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 898089,
      "end_ms": 899869,
      "text": "这群人就是旺左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 899869,
      "end_ms": 902129,
      "text": "旺左现在被王佐推出来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 902129,
      "end_ms": 902689,
      "text": "发现没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 902689,
      "end_ms": 905140,
      "text": "他们线下是有这个目的的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 905140,
      "end_ms": 908580,
      "text": "是在瞎逼搞的瞎搞瞎逼搞推小孩出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 908580,
      "end_ms": 910260,
      "text": "瞎逼逼搞自己被监视了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 910260,
      "end_ms": 910780,
      "text": "被控制了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 910780,
      "end_ms": 911460,
      "text": "不能瞎逼搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 911460,
      "end_ms": 913820,
      "text": "推他妈高中生出来瞎逼搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 914539,
      "end_ms": 917179,
      "text": "去年推你妈的哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 917179,
      "end_ms": 920079,
      "text": "不是上半年还是还是去年推"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 920399,
      "end_ms": 922779,
      "text": "推一个大一学生来搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 922779,
      "end_ms": 925030,
      "text": "现在推高中生来搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 925030,
      "end_ms": 926450,
      "text": "这就是他们的计划"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 926450,
      "end_ms": 927590,
      "text": "就是他们的目的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 933910,
      "end_ms": 934870,
      "text": "侮辱我们的历史"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 934870,
      "end_ms": 938710,
      "text": "唯物主义的伟大进程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 940140,
      "end_ms": 944840,
      "text": "有个蠢人来扮演先锋队的形象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 944840,
      "end_ms": 946160,
      "text": "用一群小孩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 947520,
      "end_ms": 951080,
      "text": "高中生蠢人来玷污侮辱我们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 954960,
      "end_ms": 956840,
      "text": "这个不是什么教育不教育的问题了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 958120,
      "end_ms": 959160,
      "text": "你要拍个短剧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 959160,
      "end_ms": 961360,
      "text": "请你在里面演群众"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 961840,
      "end_ms": 962920,
      "text": "你要拍个短剧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 962920,
      "end_ms": 964340,
      "text": "请你在里面演小孩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 964340,
      "end_ms": 965860,
      "text": "你小孩就演小孩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 965860,
      "end_ms": 968540,
      "text": "你有什么资格演头目"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 968540,
      "end_ms": 970220,
      "text": "你有什么资格演组织者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 970220,
      "end_ms": 970740,
      "text": "领导者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 973180,
      "end_ms": 976490,
      "text": "无能拥众可笑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 976490,
      "end_ms": 979510,
      "text": "小儿妄作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 979510,
      "end_ms": 980570,
      "text": "什么都不懂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 980570,
      "end_ms": 983870,
      "text": "什么都不会扮演头目"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 984740,
      "end_ms": 987580,
      "text": "很明显的这些望左里面我再强调一遍啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 987580,
      "end_ms": 989460,
      "text": "望左当中懦弱的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 371,
      "start_ms": 989460,
      "end_ms": 994730,
      "text": "卑微的啊那种什么会推一个胆子最肥的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 372,
      "start_ms": 994730,
      "end_ms": 997740,
      "text": "让他去冲瞎逼搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 373,
      "start_ms": 997740,
      "end_ms": 1001430,
      "text": "其实是这些懦弱的胆小的人的一个诡计"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 374,
      "start_ms": 1001430,
      "end_ms": 1002950,
      "text": "他从他倒是倒霉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 375,
      "start_ms": 1002950,
      "end_ms": 1004590,
      "text": "我们他妈的反正又爽到了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 376,
      "start_ms": 1004590,
      "end_ms": 1006680,
      "text": "又玩到了狐假虎威"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 377,
      "start_ms": 1007120,
      "end_ms": 1011680,
      "text": "同时王佐你看这个B站还是QQ群"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 378,
      "start_ms": 1011680,
      "end_ms": 1013440,
      "text": "微信群里面那些只敢发言的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 379,
      "start_ms": 1013440,
      "end_ms": 1015040,
      "text": "还偷偷给我传各种截图的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 380,
      "start_ms": 1015040,
      "end_ms": 1016250,
      "text": "就用网左"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 381,
      "start_ms": 1016659,
      "end_ms": 1018659,
      "text": "还有录音截图都是他们传给我的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 382,
      "start_ms": 1018659,
      "end_ms": 1023390,
      "text": "这些王族呢又去推这群望族这么一个关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 383,
      "start_ms": 1023390,
      "end_ms": 1024470,
      "text": "我再强调一遍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 384,
      "start_ms": 1024470,
      "end_ms": 1026790,
      "text": "这群望族最勇的那批人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 385,
      "start_ms": 1026790,
      "end_ms": 1029409,
      "text": "又是被那些老登中登"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 386,
      "start_ms": 1029409,
      "end_ms": 1030848,
      "text": "还有那几个20几岁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 387,
      "start_ms": 1030848,
      "end_ms": 1033289,
      "text": "人生已经彻底无望的游牧无产者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 388,
      "start_ms": 1037520,
      "end_ms": 1038800,
      "text": "好玩儿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 389,
      "start_ms": 1038800,
      "end_ms": 1040920,
      "text": "嗯好玩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 390,
      "start_ms": 1040920,
      "end_ms": 1042660,
      "text": "不要把自己玩死"
